        "loc_mu_bei_mountain",
        "sys_demonic_path"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Shang Clan is a large clan with many clansmen. That scale helps explain why A grade aptitude is common there, alongside recruiting demonic Gu Masters and buying aptitude-changing Gu.",
